Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] placement: distinguish collection roots and preserve
 artifact custody

Keep bare roots queued, preserve foreign-home and board artifact identity, and cache by requires/config. Shared-deadline probes already exist; pin two slow remotes. RED: 11 failures. GREEN: 173 tests across all four requested/new suites.
